wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#7FA6D6;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR;fontSize=11;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="56" y="980" width="338" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="STEP3-2 전체 흐름_n_31" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#333840&quot;&gt;웹캠은 안전에 관여하지 않는다&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;여기서 나온 좌표는 재탐지 방향과 KPI 계측에만 쓴다.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;정지·회피 판단에 쓰지 않는 것이 설계 원칙이다 (NF-07).&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F8FA;strokeColor=#C9CFD6;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR;fontSize=11;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="42" y="1072" width="366" height="67" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="STEP3-2 전체 흐름_n_32" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1B4F91&quot;&gt;운영자 화면 — 2대 상태 표시 (뷰어)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#7FA6D6;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR;fontSize=11;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="506" y="428" width="338" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="STEP3-2 전체 흐름_n_33" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1B4F91&quot;&gt;자재 요청 → RequestMission&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#7FA6D6;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR;fontSize=11;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="506" y="475" width="338" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="STEP3-2 전체 흐름_n_34" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1B4F91&quot;&gt;종료 버튼 → OperatorCommand&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;RETURN / RETURN_ALL&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#7FA6D6;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR;fontSize=11;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="506" y="522" width="338" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="STEP3-2 전체 흐름_n_35" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1B4F91&quot;&gt;서술자 수신 → 로봇 배정&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;트랙 ID 작은 쪽 먼저 (결정론적)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#7FA6D6;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR;fontSize=11;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="506" y="642" width="338" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="STEP3-2 전체 흐름_n_36" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6F5610&quot;&gt;배터리 25 % 이상인가?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;아니오 → 미션 거부 · 사유 기록&lt;/font&gt;" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8DE;strokeColor=#B8912B;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR;fontSize=11;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="506" y="707" width="338" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="STEP3-2 전체 흐름_n_37" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1B4F91&quot;&gt;mission/assigned 발행&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#7FA6D6;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR;fontSize=11;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="506" y="772" width="338" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="STEP3-2 전체 흐름_n_38" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1B4F91&quot;&gt;종료 명령 수신 시 mission/finish 발행&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#7FA6D6;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR;fontSize=11;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="506" y="819" width="338" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id=